Before modifying code, provide a concise audit report covering:

Current camera architecture and frame-processing flow.
The files and classes responsible for UVC discovery, permission, opening, streaming, and rendering.
How the application distinguishes the thermal camera from the RGB camera.
The most likely reasons why the RGB camera is not working.
